---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SiteImage from "../components/SiteImage.astro";
---
<Layout page="About">

    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
    <section class="mission-vision about-single">
      <div class="about-story-content">
      <h2 class="section-title">Our Story</h2>
      <div class="about-single-text">
        <p>
          Founded in 2019, Machina Construction Ltd. was built on a strong foundation of experience, expertise, and a
          shared vision for excellence in the sewer and watermain industry. The founders of Machina began working under
          the guidance of their father, one of two owners of Pachino Construction Co. Ltd., where they developed
          their industry knowledge and hands-on experience. This experience played a pivotal role in shaping their
          understanding of the industry, instilling the values of quality workmanship, accountability, and operational
          excellence that continue to guide Machina today.
        </p>
        <p>
          For over five decades, Pachino Construction Co. Ltd. has remained a family-operated company, successfully
          completing hundreds of major infrastructure projects throughout the Greater Toronto Area and surrounding
          regions. Its longstanding presence in the industry is a testament to its commitment to craftsmanship, safety,
          and client satisfaction.
        </p>
        <p>
          Building on this legacy, Machina Construction maintains a strong working relationship with Pachino Construction,
          reflecting a shared commitment to innovation, quality, and sustainable growth. This partnership allows both
          organizations to leverage their collective experience, resources, and technical expertise to deliver enhanced
          value across a broad range of construction services. Together, Pachino and Machina continue to uphold a
          tradition of excellence while adapting to meet the evolving demands of the modern construction environment.
        </p>
        <p>
          At Machina, we are committed to delivering quality work through innovation, collaboration, and the strength of
          our people. We recognize and value the skills, dedication, and contributions of every employee and contractor
          we work with. Our mission is to provide exceptional service to our clients while embracing advancements in
          technology that position us at the forefront of the industry.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are dedicated to continuous improvement across all aspects of our operations. Through ongoing education,
          training, and professional development, we foster a culture that promotes growth, accountability, and long-term
          success for our team.
        </p>
        <p>
          Looking ahead, Machina Construction is focused on building a diverse and highly skilled workforce by creating
          opportunities for individuals who are motivated to learn, develop, and build lasting careers within the
          construction industry. As we continue to grow, we remain committed to strengthening our team, advancing our
          capabilities, and contributing to the future of critical infrastructure development.
        </p>
      </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="company-banner" aria-labelledby="company-banner-title">
      <div class="company-banner-heading">
        <p class="company-banner-eyebrow">Built on trusted relationships</p>
        <h2 id="company-banner-title">Working Across Ontario</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="company-logo-grid" aria-label="Municipalities and regions Machina Construction has worked with">
        <div class="company-logo-slot"><SiteImage src="images/logos-and-misc/York-Region-Logo.png" alt="York Region" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 40vw, 18vw" /></div>
        <div class="company-logo-slot"><SiteImage src="images/logos-and-misc/City-of-Toronto-Logo.png" alt="City of Toronto" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 40vw, 18vw" /></div>
        <div class="company-logo-slot"><SiteImage src="images/logos-and-misc/Town-of-Ajax-Logo.png" alt="Town of Ajax" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 40vw, 18vw" /></div>
        <div class="company-logo-slot"><SiteImage src="images/logos-and-misc/Peel-Region-Logo.png" alt="Peel Region" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 40vw, 18vw" /></div>
        <div class="company-logo-slot"><SiteImage class="company-logo--compact"
            src="images/logos-and-misc/Halton-Region-Logo.png" alt="Halton Region" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 40vw, 18vw" /></div>
        <div class="company-logo-slot"><SiteImage src="images/logos-and-misc/Brampton-Logo.png" alt="City of Brampton" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 40vw, 18vw" /></div>
        <div class="company-logo-slot"><SiteImage class="company-logo--compact"
            src="images/logos-and-misc/Clarington-Logo.png" alt="Municipality of Clarington" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 40vw, 18vw" /></div>
        <div class="company-logo-slot"><SiteImage src="images/logos-and-misc/Markham-Logo.png" alt="City of Markham" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 40vw, 18vw" /></div>
        <div class="company-logo-slot"><SiteImage src="images/logos-and-misc/Durham-Region-Logo.png" alt="Durham Region" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 40vw, 18vw" /></div>
        <div class="company-logo-slot"><SiteImage class="company-logo--compact"
            src="images/logos-and-misc/Vaughan-Logo.png" alt="City of Vaughan" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 40vw, 18vw" /></div>
      </div>
    </section>

</Layout>
